i) 
the working conditions and the risks to the safety of persons at 
the place where the work equipment is to be used; 
ii) 
in the case of work equipment for access and egress, the 
distance to be negotiated; 
iii) 
the distance and consequences of a potential fall; 
iv) 
the duration and frequency of use; 
v) 
the need for easy and timely evacuation and rescue in an 
emergency; and  
vi) 
any additional risk posed by the use, installation or removal of 
that work equipment or by evacuation and rescue from it;
